---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { games } from '../data/games';
import { studio } from '../data/studio';
---
<BaseLayout title="About the Studio" description="Get to know Red Parasol, an independent Roblox game development studio creating roleplay worlds and simulations.">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">HELLO, WE'RE RED PARASOL</p><h1>Made to play.<br/><em>Made your own.</em></h1><p>We're an independent Roblox game development studio creating places worth exploring, roles worth stepping into, and stories worth sharing.</p></div>
      <div class="about-mascot-wrap"><span class="about-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span><img class="about-mascot" src="/images/brand/mascot-full.webp" alt="Red Parasol red panda mascot holding a parasol" width="768" height="768"/></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-dark about-content">
    <div class="container about-content-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow red-eyebrow">WHAT WE BELIEVE</p><h2>A world is only<br/><em>the beginning.</em></h2></div>
      <div><p>Red Parasol is an independent Roblox game studio dedicated to building and growing immersive roleplay and simulation experiences. Our worlds are designed for players who want to do more than follow a predetermined path, giving communities the freedom to create stories of their own.</p><p>Whether you're exploring school life, serving in government, trading your way through a new world, or finding a place to belong, our games are built around what happens when players make a world their own.</p><a class="text-link" href="/games/">Explore our {games.length} active experiences <span class="outbound-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section about-closer"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PROMISE</p><h2>We build worlds.<br/><em>You write the story.</em></h2></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
